OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre closes for second
OL,4,Atime in a month
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shopping centre has shut for the
OL,7,Fsecond time in less than a month - this
OL,8,Ftime after a failure of a tempered
OL,9,Fglass panel.
OL,11,FThe Buttermarket in Ipswich announced
OL,12,Fon Monday night it would have to close
OL,13,Ftemporarily after the issue in the
OL,14,Fnorth mall.
OL,16,FIt said it would reopen "as soon as
OL,17,Fsafety measures are in place" and it
OL,18,Fapologised for any inconvenience
OL,19,Fcaused.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
